          "sent_utc": "2026-08-10T06:46:16.541Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-10T00:46:16-06:00",
          "text": "Chad Stone Nelson Cook I just spoke to our after sales contact for WDS. The machine is online and they have an electronical engineer going through the program. They will respond to the meeting invite with any details and join meeting if we still need support. \n \nThey also wanted to remind us that we have 24hr support to electronical engineers using our LCC Advanced Support contract. We can call 00492634 500 and reach their team. During their german office time 7-4:30 you will get directly through and before or after you have to enter your password (the 6 Numbers of the W-line-number, in this case 838981)",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786362912476",
          "from": "Itzel Chavez",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-10T11:55:12.476Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-10T05:55:12-06:00",
          "text": "Please remind your teams to leave program bars on the storage racks, they were left on top of platforms.",
